# Con Docker: http://localhost:8080 — con `dotnet run`: http://localhost:5043
@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080
@token = pega-aqui-el-token-del-login
@n8nKey = pega-aqui-N8N_API_KEY-del-.env

### Login del personal (Admin, Cook, Delivery)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@hamburguesa.local", "password": "ADMIN_PASSWORD-del-.env" }

### Mi perfil
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar usuarios (solo Admin) — filtros opcionales ?role=Cook&includeInactive=true
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear cocinero (Cook) / domiciliario (Delivery) / admin (Admin)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Carlos Cocina", "email": "cocina@hamburguesa.local", "phone": "3001112233", "password": "Cocina123!", "role": "Cook" }

### Crear cliente (Customer): sin contraseña, teléfono obligatorio
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Ana Cliente", "phone": "3009998877", "role": "Customer" }

### n8n: crear o actualizar cliente por teléfono
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/integrations/n8n/customers
X-Api-Key: {{n8nKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Ana Cliente", "phone": "3009998877" }

### n8n: buscar cliente por teléfono
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/integrations/n8n/customers/3009998877
X-Api-Key: {{n8nKey}}
